scan 262144 bytes; drop images, data URLs and lines of links alone; links to their text; heading markers dropped; blank runs collapsed; delimiters removed; title 300, url 300, site 200 bytes; text at most 8192 bytes on a line boundary keeping half the limits, else a rune boundary, and 8064 tokens with the rest of the prompt at 3 quarter-tokens an ASCII letter and 4 any other byte; answer 1024 tokens